{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02957","headline":"奉和圣制烛龙斋祭 · 张九龄","name":"奉和圣制烛龙斋祭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上帝临下，鉴亦有光。\n孰云阴隲，惟圣克彰。\n六月徂暑，四郊愆阳。\n我后其勤，告于坛场。\n精意允溢，羣灵鼓舞。\n蔚兮朝云，沛然时雨。\n雨我原田，亦既有年。\n烛龙煌煌，明宗报祀。\n于以助之，天人帝子。\n闻诗有训，国风兹始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}